Reserve button shows error for unavailable dates\n537:#### Test: Booking card is sticky on desktop viewport\n542:#### Test: Booking card date pickers and guest selector are functional on repeated use\n547:### Component: ReviewsSection\n549:#### Test: Reviews section displays average ratings by category\n553:#### Test: Reviews section displays overall average rating and total review count\n557:#### Test: Reviews section displays individual review cards\n561:#### Test: Review cards display guest avatar or initial\n565:#### Test: Reviews section shows message when property has no reviews\n569:#### Test: Reviews section handles pagination or \"Show more\" for many reviews\n573:#### Test: Clicking \"Show all reviews\" reveals all review cards\n578:#### Test: Reviews are ordered by most recent first\n582:### Component: HostInfoCard\n584:#### Test: Host info card displays host name, avatar, bio, and member since date\n588:#### Test: Host info card displays number of listings\n592:#### Test: Host info card shows placeholder avatar when host has no avatar\n596:#### Test: Host info card displays correctly when host has no bio\n600:## Page: My Trips (`/trips`)\n604:### Component: TripsTabs\n606:#### Test: My Trips page requires login\n611:#### Test: My Trips page defaults to Upcoming tab\n615:#### Test: Upcoming tab shows pending and confirmed future bookings\n620:#### Test: Switching to Past tab shows completed bookings\n625:#### Test: Switching to Cancelled tab shows cancelled bookings\n630:#### Test: Switching back to Upcoming tab from another tab\n635:#### Test: Tab shows empty state when no bookings exist for that category\n640:#### Test: Upcoming tab empty state message\n645:#### Test: Cancelled tab empty state message\n650:#### Test: Tabs are functional on repeated use\n655:### Component: TripCard\n657:#### Test: Trip card displays all required information\n661:#### Test: Trip card displays correct status badge colors\n665:#### Test: Trip card shows property image or placeholder\n669:#### Test: Clicking trip card navigates to booking details\n674:#### Test: Cancel button appears on pending bookings\n678:#### Test: Cancel button appears on confirmed bookings\n682:#### Test: Cancel button does not appear on completed bookings\n686:#### Test: Cancel button does not appear on already cancelled bookings\n690:#### Test: Write Review button appears on completed bookings without a review\n694:#### Test: Write Review button does not appear on completed bookings that already have a review\n698:#### Test: Clicking Write Review button navigates to review page\n703:#### Test: Write Review button does not appear on pending, confirmed, or cancelled bookings\n707:#### Test: Trip cards are ordered by check-in date\n711:### Component: CancelBookingDialog\n713:#### Test: Clicking Cancel button opens confirmation dialog\n718:#### Test: Confirming cancellation updates booking status to cancelled\n723:#### Test: Dismissing cancellation dialog keeps booking unchanged\n728:#### Test: Closing the dialog via overlay click keeps booking unchanged\n733:#### Test: Cancel dialog shows property and date context\n737:#### Test: After cancellation, booking moves from Upcoming to Cancelled tab\n742:#### Test: Cancel dialog is functional on repeated use\n747:## Page: Host Dashboard (`/hosting`)\n751:### Component: StatsOverview\n753:#### Test: Host Dashboard requires login — redirects unauthenticated users\n758:#### Test: Host Dashboard requires host status — shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts\n763:#### Test: Stats overview displays total listings count\n768:#### Test: Stats overview displays active bookings count\n773:#### Test: Stats overview displays total earnings\n778:#### Test: Stats overview displays average rating\n783:#### Test: Stats overview shows zeros for a new host with no data\n788:#### Test: Host Dashboard displays navigation tabs for Listings and Bookings\n793:#### Test: Switching between Listings and Bookings tabs\n798:### Component: ListingsTab\n